WEBVTT

00:10.802 --> 00:12.804
BASED ON THE KINGDOM OF THE GODS BY YLAB

01:34.594 --> 01:36.805
THE FIVE ARMIES' BASE CAMP
IN MUNGYEONG SAEJAE

04:37.819 --> 04:38.945
It is odd, sir.

04:39.737 --> 04:42.907
There are only a few of them.
We should go to His Royal Highness.

07:06.801 --> 07:07.885
What did you do...

07:09.637 --> 07:11.097
to His Royal Highness?

07:11.180 --> 07:15.226
A criminal who committed high treason
does not deserve such a title.

07:15.309 --> 07:17.687
You are the one
who committed high treason,

07:18.146 --> 07:19.313
not His Royal Highness!

07:19.397 --> 07:20.982
Let His Majesty be the judge of...

07:22.400 --> 07:24.777
which one of us is indeed guilty
of high treason.

07:27.029 --> 07:29.782
His Majesty kindly came
all the way here...

07:31.325 --> 07:34.620
to punish the traitor himself.

07:47.383 --> 07:48.384
Step aside.

07:48.926 --> 07:52.138
I will not forgive anyone
who stands in my way.

07:54.432 --> 07:55.683
Three years ago,

07:56.058 --> 08:00.146
you saved countless lives in Gyeongsang.

08:00.229 --> 08:03.357
You are a man of
such remarkable wisdom and bravery,

08:04.525 --> 08:06.819
so why did you decide
to side with the traitor?

08:07.403 --> 08:11.157
I understand that you cannot desert him
for he was once your pupil.

08:13.409 --> 08:15.828
But if you admit your wrongdoing now,

08:17.163 --> 08:19.874
I will spare your life.

08:36.599 --> 08:38.518
Father...

09:14.637 --> 09:16.514
Everyone that I love

09:16.931 --> 09:19.100
either died or was ousted.

09:20.059 --> 09:22.311
You are my one and only son...

09:22.937 --> 09:24.855
and the most important person in my life.

09:26.816 --> 09:29.151
So you must survive, no matter what.

09:30.486 --> 09:33.281
Survive and prove
that you are different from them,

09:33.864 --> 09:35.408
as well as from me.

09:36.158 --> 09:38.160
Show them what a true king...

09:38.911 --> 09:40.663
ought to be.

09:44.625 --> 09:45.876
Father.

09:48.087 --> 09:49.714
It's me, Chang.

10:01.517 --> 10:02.893
Thanks to you,

10:04.145 --> 10:07.189
I have been living in hell
for the past three years.

10:07.690 --> 10:11.736
I will not let you deceive me
like you did back then.

10:14.405 --> 10:15.948
His Majesty...

10:17.658 --> 10:19.118
already passed away.

10:20.453 --> 10:24.540
But blinded by his greed for power,

10:24.624 --> 10:26.834
Cho Hak-ju resurrected His Majesty...

10:29.128 --> 10:32.340
and turned him into a monster
with an insatiable hunger for human flesh.

10:33.341 --> 10:35.551
Since His Majesty passed away,

10:36.677 --> 10:37.928
the throne...

10:39.472 --> 10:40.848
should be passed down...

10:41.849 --> 10:43.684
to His Royal Highness
according to the law.

10:54.487 --> 10:55.821
What are you waiting for?

10:56.489 --> 10:57.323
Shoot him.

11:10.127 --> 11:12.421
Shoot him, or I will slay you as well.

11:38.114 --> 11:39.281
Shoot him down!

13:11.582 --> 13:12.958
I...

13:15.628 --> 13:17.046
beheaded...

13:19.673 --> 13:21.967
I beheaded my father.

13:24.136 --> 13:25.137
Your Royal Highness.

13:28.182 --> 13:30.184
It is not your fault.

13:32.937 --> 13:34.021
Your Royal Highness.

13:36.565 --> 13:37.650
You are now...

13:40.152 --> 13:43.823
the king of this kingdom.

14:21.652 --> 14:24.071
Your Majesty!

15:02.610 --> 15:03.819
The Five Armies...

15:05.487 --> 15:08.407
shall arrest the traitor
that dared to assassinate His Majesty...

15:09.700 --> 15:13.245
as well as all of his men!

15:29.219 --> 15:32.932
HANYANG

15:34.642 --> 15:39.021
ROYAL COMMANDERY DIVISION

15:43.275 --> 15:44.485
Do you really plan to inspect

15:44.735 --> 15:47.321
the private residence
of the Queen's family?

15:47.404 --> 15:51.367
We found trails of blood from the creek
where that dead woman was found

15:51.450 --> 15:53.619
all the way to Naeseonjae.

15:54.203 --> 15:56.288
I am certain
that she escaped from Naeseonjae.

15:56.372 --> 15:57.206
Also,

15:57.998 --> 16:00.542
she said more people
are held captive in that place.

16:01.126 --> 16:02.378
We must investigate Naeseonjae.

16:02.461 --> 16:03.629
This...

16:04.380 --> 16:06.924
is obviously connected
to the Haewon Cho Clan.

16:07.800 --> 16:09.718
Can you handle them, knowing their power?

16:11.345 --> 16:12.388
Right.

16:14.139 --> 16:16.684
Like you said, the Haewon Cho Clan...

16:18.352 --> 16:20.396
is the most powerful family
in this country.

16:20.479 --> 16:21.355
However,

16:22.398 --> 16:24.233
we must get to the bottom of this

16:24.316 --> 16:26.485
and uncover the truth
if such a heinous event...

16:27.903 --> 16:29.738
actually took place there.

16:34.368 --> 16:38.122
The Royal Commandery Division
will investigate Naeseonjae.

16:41.792 --> 16:44.253
NAESEONJAE

16:52.678 --> 16:54.096
We must hurry.

17:10.571 --> 17:14.033
Hey, what are you doing?

17:14.116 --> 17:15.993
Jeez, seriously.

17:16.493 --> 17:18.829
You drunkard, you threw up everything.

17:18.912 --> 17:19.830
Damn it.

17:19.913 --> 17:21.749
- I am dying.
- You puked all over me.

17:22.499 --> 17:23.417
Goodness.

17:23.959 --> 17:24.960
Seriously.

17:29.631 --> 17:32.760
What brings you here at this late hour?

17:33.844 --> 17:36.430
We received a report
that there has been a murder here.

17:36.722 --> 17:39.224
We will search the house.
You must all cooperate.

17:40.559 --> 17:42.436
- Spread out and search the place.
- Yes, sir!

17:42.519 --> 17:45.731
This is a private residence
of Her Majesty's family.

17:45.814 --> 17:48.233
Everyone here is always careful
with their conduct

17:48.317 --> 17:49.902
not to harm Her Majesty's reputation.

17:50.319 --> 17:53.030
Such a horrible incident
could not have taken place here.

17:53.322 --> 17:54.740
Search thoroughly!

18:16.303 --> 18:17.596
Who lives there?

18:18.138 --> 18:21.892
It is a place for guests,
but it has been empty for a long time.

19:03.517 --> 19:05.686
Sir, there is something you need to see.

19:14.027 --> 19:15.070
Over here, sir.

19:17.364 --> 19:19.533
The soil is frozen
as we are in the middle of winter,

19:19.616 --> 19:21.326
but this spot alone is soft.

19:22.327 --> 19:24.663
It looks like something
had been buried here.

19:45.851 --> 19:47.269
This way. Let's go this way.

19:58.989 --> 20:01.825
Catch those men carrying the palanquin!

20:01.909 --> 20:03.202
Catch them all!

20:03.285 --> 20:05.537
- Get them!
- Do not let anyone get away.

20:17.549 --> 20:18.967
Block the way!

20:19.718 --> 20:22.471
- Stop!
- Stop right there!

20:36.276 --> 20:37.277
They were all...

20:38.028 --> 20:39.947
found at Naeseonjae?

20:40.405 --> 20:41.323
Yes, sir.

20:41.865 --> 20:45.285
We found corpses
of seven pregnant women and infants.

20:46.203 --> 20:49.665
The women were stabbed,
but something is odd about the children.

20:50.332 --> 20:52.876
All the girls were strangled to death,

20:52.960 --> 20:55.629
but it doesn't seem like
anything was done to the boy.

20:57.214 --> 20:59.758
He must have been stillborn.

20:59.925 --> 21:00.801
But how...

21:01.802 --> 21:03.553
How could something like this happen?

21:06.265 --> 21:08.183
Isn't it strange though?

21:09.268 --> 21:11.603
Why is it that they killed
all the female newborns...

21:12.437 --> 21:14.731
but none of the boys?

21:15.565 --> 21:18.777
What are you trying to say?

21:20.904 --> 21:24.533
I do not know who did this,
but the culprit...

21:25.951 --> 21:28.245
must have been after a baby boy.

21:40.424 --> 21:41.800
It's the horn.

21:44.511 --> 21:47.556
It means His Majesty passed away.

21:57.816 --> 21:59.943
What on earth happened?

22:03.363 --> 22:07.451
The Chief State Councillor,
who is in Joryeong, sent this letter.

22:11.038 --> 22:13.957
In order to bring the plague
in Gyeongsang under control,

22:14.041 --> 22:16.168
as well as to punish Chang
for committing high treason,

22:16.293 --> 22:18.211
His Majesty came all the way to Joryeong,

22:18.712 --> 22:21.506
despite battling an illness
that was affecting His Majesty.

22:21.923 --> 22:25.218
We managed to bring the plague
under control in Mungyeong Saejae,

22:25.302 --> 22:27.679
but Chang and his nefarious aides
took advantage of the chaos

22:27.763 --> 22:29.890
and raided us to seize the throne.

22:30.557 --> 22:34.019
And Chang decapitated His Majesty
with his own two hands.

22:34.561 --> 22:41.360
Your Majesty!

22:41.443 --> 22:47.657
Please return to us, Your Majesty!

23:40.752 --> 23:42.671
What should we do
with Lord Ahn Hyeon's corpse?

23:47.968 --> 23:51.805
He was a hero who saved our country,
even though he sided with the traitor.

23:53.598 --> 23:55.976
Dress him in shrouds
and give him a proper burial.

23:56.351 --> 23:57.227
Yes, sir.

23:59.729 --> 24:01.231
The Ministers of Taxation and Rites...

24:01.314 --> 24:02.357
HANYANG CONFERENCE HALL

24:02.441 --> 24:04.025
...will oversee the state funeral.

24:04.109 --> 24:06.695
The chief magistrate of
the Capital District Office

24:06.778 --> 24:08.780
should double-check the route
to the burial site...

24:09.406 --> 24:11.867
and build or repair bridges if necessary.

24:12.868 --> 24:15.579
However, there is a more pressing issue.

24:16.872 --> 24:18.540
The throne is vacant at the moment.

24:18.748 --> 24:20.917
We must quickly decide
who will ascend the throne.

24:21.001 --> 24:24.337
The Queen is acting as regent
at the moment.

24:25.297 --> 24:27.924
Besides, the Queen
is expecting her baby soon.

24:29.134 --> 24:31.094
If a prince is born,

24:31.386 --> 24:33.555
he will naturally ascend the throne.

24:33.638 --> 24:35.390
But what if it is not a boy?

24:36.683 --> 24:40.145
We must find someone from
the collateral bloodlines to be prepared.

24:41.104 --> 24:44.816
There are children of Prince Noseong,
who was exiled and executed in Ganghwa.

24:44.900 --> 24:48.987
His children are His Majesty's
distant collateral relatives.

24:49.404 --> 24:51.156
Are you suggesting
we enthrone a puppet king?

24:51.239 --> 24:53.200
The Second State Councillor is right.

24:53.283 --> 24:55.911
We must follow the rule of primogeniture.

24:55.994 --> 24:59.414
We should wait
until the Queen gives birth.

24:59.498 --> 25:01.041
This is the head eunuch.

25:03.585 --> 25:06.463
We just heard
from the Office of Royal Delivery.

25:07.631 --> 25:11.635
Her Majesty has just started
to experience labor pain.

25:13.094 --> 25:15.722
The whole kingdom has been plagued
by misfortune as of late.

25:15.805 --> 25:18.099
I suppose we can expect
some good fortune now.

25:18.642 --> 25:23.146
Let us wait for the time being
and pray that a prince will be born.

25:23.230 --> 25:24.439
Yes.

25:24.523 --> 25:27.150
DELIVERY ROOM AT THE QUEEN'S PALACE

25:29.319 --> 25:30.445
Her Majesty...

25:31.488 --> 25:33.949
has been waiting for you
and the female physician.

25:37.953 --> 25:39.120
Let's go in.

25:48.505 --> 25:51.174
Your Majesty, this is the head court lady.

26:04.521 --> 26:07.232
The royal physician is in the next room.

26:18.660 --> 26:20.662
What happened
to the rest of the pregnant women?

26:21.496 --> 26:24.249
I took care of them
as per Your Majesty's order.

26:34.134 --> 26:36.970
So you'd like me to push ahead
with the investigation on Naeseonjae?

26:37.053 --> 26:38.346
That's right.

26:38.888 --> 26:41.558
But be as discreet as possible
so that no one finds out.

26:41.641 --> 26:42.892
Understood, sir.

26:43.393 --> 26:44.436
We do not have much time.

26:44.519 --> 26:46.896
We must find out the truth at all costs...

26:47.564 --> 26:49.941
before the Queen gives birth.

26:52.986 --> 26:55.488
THE BASE CAMP IN MUNGYEONG SAEJAE

26:57.449 --> 26:58.283
What brings you here?

26:58.366 --> 27:00.952
The magistrate ordered me to stop by

27:01.036 --> 27:03.163
and check on His Royal Highness.

27:03.246 --> 27:04.956
The magistrate said that?

27:06.082 --> 27:06.916
Yes, sir.

27:08.793 --> 27:10.587
CHO BEOM-PAL

27:42.160 --> 27:43.286
Your Royal Highness.

27:44.496 --> 27:46.081
Are you all right?

27:49.834 --> 27:52.295
Going all the way to Hanyang
will not be easy.

27:53.380 --> 27:56.633
First, I will treat your wound
to make sure it will not be infected.

28:37.799 --> 28:39.801
They knew we were coming.

28:40.510 --> 28:43.555
Someone set a trap for us.

28:44.806 --> 28:45.807
That means...

28:47.225 --> 28:48.768
there is a spy among us.

28:51.396 --> 28:53.231
This isn't the time to doubt each other.

28:56.192 --> 28:57.152
What do you mean?

28:57.235 --> 28:59.028
I do not want to die here.

28:59.112 --> 28:59.946
No.

29:01.823 --> 29:05.034
Even if I must die, I will be sure
to get my family's revenge first.

29:06.786 --> 29:09.122
Don't you all want to avenge
Lord Ahn Hyeon's death?

29:09.748 --> 29:11.708
I would do anything if we can avenge...

29:12.292 --> 29:13.793
Lord Ahn's death.

29:14.919 --> 29:16.463
Is there a way?

29:18.173 --> 29:19.716
If we're willing to risk our lives,

29:22.635 --> 29:24.971
we should at least be able
to take Cho Hak-ju with us.

29:28.558 --> 29:29.976
Our only chance is...

29:31.019 --> 29:32.520
just before we leave for Hanyang.

30:14.521 --> 30:15.730
What's the matter?

30:15.855 --> 30:17.649
Is something wrong?

30:20.652 --> 30:22.612
We are ready to leave, sir.

30:25.198 --> 30:27.283
Bring all the prisoners.

30:48.304 --> 30:49.639
Get up!

31:45.361 --> 31:47.071
They are begging to be killed.

31:47.155 --> 31:48.948
Only spare the Crown Prince's life.

31:49.741 --> 31:51.492
Kill all the rest.

31:56.247 --> 31:57.332
Stand guard!

32:36.412 --> 32:38.331
Arrest that bastard at once!

33:11.072 --> 33:11.990
It's a monster!

33:16.953 --> 33:18.454
It's a monster!

34:13.426 --> 34:14.635
Shoot him in the head.

34:15.762 --> 34:17.138
Aim for the head.

34:34.864 --> 34:37.033
Your Royal Highness,
there is only one way...

34:38.659 --> 34:41.204
you can survive.

34:41.537 --> 34:42.789
When I die,

34:44.916 --> 34:46.250
bring me back to life...

34:47.794 --> 34:50.338
and turn me into a monster.

34:52.465 --> 34:54.050
You must do it...

34:55.384 --> 34:58.262
to reveal the truth.

39:01.130 --> 39:03.132
Subtitle translation by Liya Choi
